#. ~ Name of a gun
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid "pneumatic assault rifle"
msgid_plural "pneumatic assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "气动突击步枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "pneumatic assault rifle"
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid ""
"A multistroke pneumatic rifle handcrafted from scrap.  It is very quiet and "
"deadly."
msgstr "用废料手工制作的气动步枪，安静而致命。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid "pneumatic bolt driver"
msgid_plural "pneumatic bolt drivers"
msgstr[0] "气动弩枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "pneumatic bolt driver"
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid ""
"An eight-shot, revolving barrel, pneumatic bolt driver handcrafted from "
"scrap.  It is very quiet and deadly."
msgstr "废料制作的转管式气动弩矢发射器，能装载八发弩矢。安静而致命。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid "pneumatic shotgun"
msgid_plural "pneumatic shotguns"
msgstr[0] "气动霰弹枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "pneumatic shotgun"
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid ""
"A double-barreled pneumatic air shotgun handcrafted from scrap.  Though it's "
"firepower is lacking compared to more conventional shotguns, this thing can "
"still pack quite a punch.  That is, if your target is directly in front of "
"you."
msgstr ""
"废料制作的双管气动霰弹枪。火力不如常规霰弹枪，但还有一定效能，只要目标离得够"
"近。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid "heavy rail rifle"
msgid_plural "heavy rail rifles"
msgstr[0] "重型自制轨道步枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "heavy rail rifle"
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid ""
"This overpowered and overengineered variant of rail rifle was designed to "
"deliver electromagnetically-driven obliteration right through whatever "
"obstacles that lies in front of it, be it buildings, vehicles or hordes of "
"walking dead.  However, the hefty bulk and weight of this weapon compared to "
"most contemporary rifles makes it somewhat cumbersome to wield; not to "
"mention that it consumes UPS charges at a tremendous rate, making it "
"impractical for use in prolonged engagements."
msgstr ""
"过度工程的轨道步枪，能够发射电磁驱动的毁灭力量。庞大的体积和重量让它难以使"
"用，极大的耗电量也让长时间开火不太可能。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid "light rail rifle"
msgid_plural "light rail rifles"
msgstr[0] "轻型自制轨道步枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "light rail rifle"
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid ""
"A single-shot, electrically propelled, steel rail launcher handcrafted from "
"scrap.  The hypervelocity metal stake that it fires is accelerated to the "
"point of spontaneous combustion by a Lorentz force generated by "
"electromagnetic induction, powered by a standard UPS."
msgstr "废料制作的单发轨道步枪。"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid "automatic bolt driver"
msgid_plural "automatic bolt drivers"
msgstr[0] "自动弩枪"

#. ~ Description of gun "automatic bolt driver"
#: C:\Users\admin\Desktop\games\cdda experimental\dda\userdata\mods\Pneumatic
#: Weapons AV\pneumatic_guns.json
msgid ""
"This complex weapon consists of two vertically stacked metal crossbows drawn "
"by electric motor, fed by a detachable magazine. Fully motorized drawing "
"mechanism enables very impressive firing rate, but makes the shots "
"significantly less accurate than manual crossbow of similar quality."
msgstr ""
"这个复杂的武器由两个垂直叠放的金属弩组成，一个可拆卸的弹匣为其供弹。全电动牵"
"引装置可实现非常惊人的射速，但严重震荡使其射击精度明显低于同类质量的手动弩。"